# DEPLOYMENT STRATEGY SELECTION CONFIGURATION
# ============================================
# This file ensures Railway prioritizes nixpacks.toml over Docker for deployment
# 
# STRATEGY SELECTION MECHANISM:
# 1. Railway detects nixpacks.toml (PRIMARY) -> Uses Nixpacks build system
# 2. Railway ignores Dockerfile* (EXCLUDED) -> Prevents Docker conflicts  
# 3. Dockerfile.backup available (FALLBACK) -> Emergency Docker option
#
# EXCLUDED DOCKER FILES (Forces nixpacks priority):
Dockerfile
Dockerfile.backup
Dockerfile.*
docker-compose.yml
docker-compose.*.yml

# DEPLOYMENT STRATEGY BENEFITS:
# ✅ Eliminates PHP extension compilation hangs
# ✅ Faster builds (5-8 minutes vs 15-20 minutes)
# ✅ Pre-compiled extensions from nixpkgs
# ✅ Railway platform optimization
# ✅ Fallback strategy available if needed

